

Attempt to create a function that does all the heavy lifting of reading
in little endian data into the usual data structures as defined in the
xmand directory readme.data.


Once the code runs and reads a valid file we may check visually a few
sample data points against the pre-existing output in the xmand/output
directory thus : 

s$ 
